        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Stop Breaking My Castle!&quot;</strong> is a game designed from the perspective of monsters who are always getting beaten up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, heroes invade the peaceful Demon Lord’s castle, killing monsters and smashing the castle walls before leaving.<br>The Demon Lord and the monsters just want to live normal lives, but it’s been a long time since their home turned into someone else’s hunting ground for leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you become the Demon Lord, summoning and evolving monsters to stop the heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon and place monsters.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/b05b3b3fed62cdc9ed019b758c15ef83.poster.avif?t=1754291215\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/b05b3b3fed62cdc9ed019b758c15ef83.webm?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/b05b3b3fed62cdc9ed019b758c15ef83.mp4?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon monsters to defend against invading heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes, driven by money and fame, have attacked the demon tribe who were living peacefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon monsters to stop the heroes and protect the peace of the demon tribe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Auto Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/d04f64513d06508fb5096edafa596b12.poster.avif?t=1754291215\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/d04f64513d06508fb5096edafa596b12.webm?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/d04f64513d06508fb5096edafa596b12.mp4?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish the heroes with the summoned monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to show the heroes, who were after gold and experience, the bitter taste of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters fight automatically, so strategic placement is necessary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/bc551edcc85d503a71e5d0b519773e02.poster.avif?t=1754291215\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/bc551edcc85d503a71e5d0b519773e02.webm?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/bc551edcc85d503a71e5d0b519773e02.mp4?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your monsters and make them stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just the heroes who get to level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish the heroes who invade for experience points with even more powerful monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 powerful types of monsters are waiting to be summoned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grinding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/2a54a80c30ac22d8ff76d7d620f03f98.poster.avif?t=1754291215\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/2a54a80c30ac22d8ff76d7d620f03f98.webm?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/2a54a80c30ac22d8ff76d7d620f03f98.mp4?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating heroes drops gold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect it with your mouse (a cute bat can help you, too).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looting isn’t just for heroes. Invading heroes must leave everything behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, if a monster falls, you can gather their souls to gain experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Stop Breaking My Castle!&quot;</strong> is a game designed from the perspective of monsters who are always getting beaten up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, heroes invade the peaceful Demon Lord’s castle, killing monsters and smashing the castle walls before leaving.<br>The Demon Lord and the monsters just want to live normal lives, but it’s been a long time since their home turned into someone else’s hunting ground for leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you become the Demon Lord, summoning and evolving monsters to stop the heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon and place monsters.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/b05b3b3fed62cdc9ed019b758c15ef83.poster.avif?t=1754291215\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/b05b3b3fed62cdc9ed019b758c15ef83.webm?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/b05b3b3fed62cdc9ed019b758c15ef83.mp4?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon monsters to defend against invading heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes, driven by money and fame, have attacked the demon tribe who were living peacefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon monsters to stop the heroes and protect the peace of the demon tribe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Auto Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/d04f64513d06508fb5096edafa596b12.poster.avif?t=1