_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/2a54a80c30ac22d8ff76d7d620f03f98.poster.avif?t=1754291215\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/2a54a80c30ac22d8ff76d7d620f03f98.webm?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826020/extras/2a54a80c30ac22d8ff76d7d620f03f98.mp4?t=1754291215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating heroes drops gold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect it with your mouse (a cute bat can help you, too).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looting isn’t just for heroes. Invading heroes must leave everything behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, if a monster falls, you can gather their souls to gain experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
